Compare compatible inventories within one explicit repository scope

Usage: pqc-scan diff --repository-scope <REPOSITORY_SCOPE> --out-dir <OUT_DIR> <BEFORE> <AFTER>

Arguments:
  <BEFORE>  
  <AFTER>   

Options:
      --repository-scope <REPOSITORY_SCOPE>  
      --out-dir <OUT_DIR>                    
  -h, --help                                 Print help
